[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m ### General Principles
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Use State-Changing Tools Early**: For tasks requiring heated/cooled/clean objects, acquire the object, then immediately use the nearest suitable appliance to change its state before any placement.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Open Before Judging Empty**: Treat any closed container as unexplored; open it and inspect contents before deciding that the goal object is absent.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Plan with Landmarks**: Continuously update and reference a map of known object and container locations to choose shortest paths and prevent aimless wandering.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Destination First Policy**: After picking up a goal object, navigate directly to the known target receptacle and place it before resuming further search.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Track Counts & Progress**: Maintain an internal counter of how many goal objects are still needed; stop searching or terminate episode only when the counter reaches zero.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Systematic Exploration**: Search every plausible surface or container exactly once before revisiting; prioritize unopened or unseen locations to cover the whole room methodically.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m ### Task-Relevant Skills
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Sink First for Cleaning**: Upon holding the target object, go straight to the nearest sink, basin, or faucet and issue the clean/use command before any placement attempts.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: Once the target object is in hand and its required state is ‘clean’._
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Phase-Ordered Plan**: Always execute clean tasks in the fixed sequence: 1) locate & acquire target object, 2) bring it to an available water source/sink to clean, 3) navigate to final location, 4) place object.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: As soon as the goal specifies the object must be clean before placement._
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **State Verification Before Drop**: Always inspect or infer the object’s state after cleaning; if still not confirmed clean, re-clean before final placement to satisfy goal conditions.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: Immediately after a cleaning action and before placing the object at its target location._
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Direct Post-Cooling Delivery**: Once the object is cooled, navigate straight to the destination and place it without extraneous detours or re-searching.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: Right after the cooling action succeeds._
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Pick Before You Wander**: If the target object is visible or discovered, take it immediately; never leave it behind to explore other places, as possession enables direct cleaning and prevents redundant searches.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: After visually confirming the presence of the target object on any surface or inside an opened container._
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Single Toggle Rule**: Use (toggle) the desklamp only after the target is in hand or co-located; avoid repeated or premature toggles that waste steps.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   _Apply when: About to interact with a desklamp during an examine task._
