[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m ### Mistakes to Avoid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Don't**: Agent repeatedly revisits the same already-searched locations or containers instead of exploring new ones.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   **Instead**: Maintain an exploration map that records which rooms/containers have been fully inspected and prioritize unvisited or unopened candidates until all reasonable options are exhausted.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Don't**: Agent decides a closed container is empty without opening it, causing missed discoveries of target objects.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   **Instead**: Always open and inspect every plausible closed container at least once before ruling it out, using a checklist of unopened containers in the current room.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Don't**: Agent ignores or walks away from target objects that are already visible and reachable.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   **Instead**: Embed a perception buffer that immediately queues pick-up actions for visible goal objects and interrupts any ongoing exploratory loop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Don't**: Agent keeps searching after acquiring enough items because it loses track of how many targets have been collected.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m   **Instead**: Maintain explicit numerical goals and increment/decrement them on every successful pickup or placement, triggering transition to the next sub-goal when counts are satisfied.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=78284)[0m - **Don't**: Agent fails to deliver a held target object to the known destination, instead continuing to wander.
